The new `&& !draftPersistenceError` condition changes which notice wins when a restore fails and the draft cannot be saved. The new test at `ChatComposer.optimistic.test.tsx:282` only covers the case with no persistence error. Neither the PR body nor a test explains this condition. Add a test, or drop the condition.

